Almost correct. Normally, when you eat a mind flayer, you have a 1 in 2
chance of gaining a point of intelligence. The message is "Yum! That
was read brain food!". When your intelligence is already as high as it
can get, you always get the message "For some reason, that tasted
bland." (not: "Surprisingly, ..."). Your intelligence will obviously
not be increased, but you do have a chance of gaining telepathy (9/15
chance, since a mind flayer is level 9).

